BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Blithewold Annual Family Clambake
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260827
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260828
DTSTAMP:20260827T204422Z
UID:527f3299a90d3c05a0676865fdb2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:Blithewold Annual Family Clambake Thursday | August 27 5:00 &#
 8211\; 8:00 PM Location: Event Tent The Great Lawn has been the scene of f
 amily clambakes for over a century! Step back in time and stroll the garde
 ns and grounds. Feast on a traditional Rhode Island clambake while you rel
 ax and enjoy the sunset\, just like so many generations of Blithewold gues
 ts. McGrath Clam Bakes will serve their famous bake\, and a cash bar will 
 be available. Unfortunately\, we cannot accommodate any food allergies sin
 ce all food is cooked together. Registration is required. Seating is open 
 with 6 people per table\; come early to sit with your friends\, or make so
 me new ones! McGrath’s buffet menu includes both meat and seafood that h
 ave been cooked together. There are no substitutions for guests that have 
 severe allergies\, or multiple dietary restrictions (vegetarian/vegan). If
  you have any other questions regarding the menu please feel free to call 
 McGrath’s at 401-847-7743. Please note that no outside alcoholic beverag
 es are permitted. Program Agenda: 4:30 PM: Gates open for check-in 5 PM: R
 hode Island “clear broth” quahog chowder station 6:15 PM: Guests invit
 ed to view the unveiling of the Clambake 6:30 PM: Clambake Buffet Registra
 tion is required. This program is limited to 100 people. This program is r
 ain or shine. Traditional Clambake Per-person: $105 Includes: Traditional 
 clambake (buffet-style): (1) 1 ¼ lb. Rhode Island lobster\, chowder\, sal
 ad\, steamers\, PEI mussels\, corn on the cob\, potatoes\, chourico\, barb
 ecued chicken\, and watermelon. Kids Meal Per-person (ages 4-12): $35 Incl
 udes: Barbecued chicken\, corn on the cob\, and red bliss potato. Register
  Here\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/blithewold-annual-
 family-clambake/109496/
LOCATION:Event Tent The Great Lawn has been the scene of family clambakes 
 for over a century! Step back in time and stroll the gardens and grounds. 
 Feast on a traditional Rhode Island clambake while you relax and enjoy the
  sunset\, just like so many generations of Blithewold guests. McGrath Clam
  Bakes will serve their famous bake\, and a cash bar will be available. Un
 fortunately\, we cannot accommodate any food allergies since all food is c
 ooked together. Registration is required. Seating is open with 6 people pe
 r table\; come early to sit with your friends\, or make some new ones! McG
 rath’s buffet menu includes both meat and seafood that have been cooked 
 together. There are no substitutions for guests that have severe allergies
 \, or multiple dietary restrictions (vegetarian/vegan). If you have any ot
 her questions regarding the menu please feel free to call McGrath’s at 4
 01-847-7743. Please note that no outside alcoholic beverages are permitted
 . Program Agenda: 4:30 PM: Gates open for check-in 5 PM: Rhode Island “c
 lear broth” quahog chowder station 6:15 PM: Guests invited to view the u
 nveiling of the Clambake 6:30 PM: Clambake Buffet Registration is required
 . This program is limited to 100 people. This program is rain or shine. Tr
 aditional Clambake Per-person: $105 Includes: Traditional clambake (buffet
 -style): (1) 1 ¼ lb. Rhode Island lobster\, chowder\, salad\, steamers\, 
 PEI mussels\, corn on the cob\, potatoes\, chourico\, barbecued chicken\, 
 and watermelon. Kids Meal Per-person (ages 4-12): $35 Includes: Barbecued 
 chicken\, corn on the cob\, and red bliss potato. Register Here Show More 
 View Website | Email 1 / 1 Additional Information\, 101 Ferry Road\, Brist
 ol\, RI 02809
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/blithewold-annual-family-clamba
 ke/109496/
