BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Federal Hill Dinner Stroll
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260904
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260905
DTSTAMP:20260827T204422Z
UID:1ba0809acb5925117d6bfead8fd2@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:A Guided Italian Dinner Experience Unwind after a long day wit
 h the Federal Hill Dinner Stroll—a decadent evening walk through Provide
 nce’s legendary Little Italy\, guided by a warm and knowledgeable host. 
 This immersive\, multi-course dining experience replaces the usual restaur
 ant routine with a handpicked lineup of top-tier small plates and drinks f
 rom some of the Hill’s most iconic spots. From seafood to house-made pas
 tas and cheeses to unforgettable desserts\, every stop is a celebration of
  one of the best culinary neighborhoods in New England. Food\, tax\, and t
 ip are all included\, so all you’ll need to think about is what to sip a
 long the way. As the streets glow under string lights and the smell of fre
 sh bread fills the air\, you’ll be treated to an evening that’s equal 
 parts indulgent and effortless. Your dedicated host is there just for your
  group—welcoming you at each stop\, handling every detail\, and making s
 ure you feel taken care of from the first bite to the last. With bold flav
 ors\, rich traditions\, and the warm hum of the neighborhood around you\, 
 it’s more than just dinner\; it’s a chance to step into the rhythm of 
 a place where food is a way of life.\n\nSource: https://www.visitrhodeisla
 nd.com/event/federal-hill-dinner-stroll/106097/
LOCATION:Cassarino's Ristorante\, 177 Atwells Avenue\, Providence\, RI 029
 03
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/federal-hill-dinner-stroll/1060
 97/
END:VEVENT
