SUMMARY:Food Truck Concert Nights - Diamond Hill Park
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260920
DTSTAMP:20260827T204422Z
UID:c61110f0d2ee251ab02333bed717@visitri-calendar
DESCRIPTION:We return to Diamond Hill Park in Cumberland for another serie
 s of memorable events in 2026. Attendance is free\, just pay for what you 
 eat and drink. All food trucks accept cash\, credit\, and debit cards 💳
 💰. Tickets are not required. Enjoy a dozen or more food trucks at each 
 event from a rotation of over 75 food trucks. In addition to great food\, 
 there will be live bands and we will be serving up local beer and wine. Sa
 vor the experience amidst the scenic beauty of the park. Choose your perfe
 ct spot\, whether it's on the grass or the gentle hills near the amphithea
 ter or around the water feature. Don't forget to bring your chairs\, picni
 c blankets\, and lawn games for added fun. No smoking\, vaping and e-cigar
 ettes are prohibited. No guests are not permitted to bring their own coole
 rs with alcohol. Pets are not encouraged. Let's care for our environment t
 ogether - please take recyclable items home with you. This event is made p
 ossible with the support of Cumberland\, Rhode Island and Cumberland Parks
  &amp\; Recreation and the town of Cumberland.\n\nSource: https://www.visi
 trhodeisland.com/event/food-truck-concert-nights-diamond-hill-park/107172/
LOCATION:Diamond Hill Park & Bike Trail\, 4125 Diamond Hill Road\, Cumberl
 and\, RI 02864 Time: Apr and Aug 5:00 PM - 8:00 PM\, May\, June and July 5
 :00 PM - 8:30 PM and Sept 4:00 PM - 7:30 PM
URL:https://www.visitrhodeisland.com/event/food-truck-concert-nights-diamo
 nd-hill-park/107172/
END:VEVENT
